                        <div class="conTxt"> 
      
     <p style="margin-top:0;margin-right:0;margin-bottom:0;margin-left:0;text-indent:25px;padding:0 0 0 0 ;text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph"><span style=";font-family:宋体;color:rgb(51,51,51);font-size:13px">日前，</span><span style=";font-family:Calibri;color:rgb(51,51,51);font-size:13px">2021</span><span style=";font-family:宋体;color:rgb(51,51,51);font-size:13px">年全国中学生生物学联赛（浙江赛区）成绩公布，依据联赛成绩选拔的浙江省生物奥赛代表队学生名单揭晓。</span><strong><span style=";font-family:宋体;color:rgb(51,51,51);font-size:13px">绍兴一中斩获</span></strong><strong><span style=";font-family:Calibri;color:rgb(51,51,51);font-size:13px">3</span></strong><strong><span style=";font-family:宋体;color:rgb(51,51,51);font-size:13px">个一等奖、</span></strong><strong><span style=";font-family:Calibri;color:rgb(51,51,51);font-size:13px">5</span></strong><strong><span style=";font-family:宋体;color:rgb(51,51,51);font-size:13px">个二等奖、</span></strong><strong><span style=";font-family:Calibri;color:rgb(51,51,51);font-size:13px">7</span></strong><strong><span style=";font-family:宋体;color:rgb(51,51,51);font-size:13px">个三等奖，其中高二（</span></strong><strong><span style=";font-family:Calibri;color:rgb(51,51,51);font-size:13px">3</span></strong><strong><span style=";font-family:宋体;color:rgb(51,51,51);font-size:13px">）班学生秦沈涛以优异成绩入选浙江省队，是绍兴市大市唯一入选的学生，</span></strong><span style=";font-family:宋体;color:rgb(51,51,51);font-size:13px">将代表浙江省参加</span><span style=";font-family:Calibri;color:rgb(51,51,51);font-size:13px">8</span><span style=";font-family:宋体;color:rgb(51,51,51);font-size:13px">月下旬在萧山中学举行的全国生物奥林匹克竞赛决赛。</span><span style=";font-family:宋体;color:rgb(51,51,51);font-size:13px">
</span></p><p style="margin-top:0;margin-right:0;margin-bottom:0;margin-left:0;padding:0 0 0 0 ;text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph"><span style=";font-family:Calibri;font-size:16px"> </span></p><p style="text-align:center"><img src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/xwzx/2021/8/202108161139075229.jpg" style="max-width: 100%; " title="202108161139075229.jpg" /></p><p style="margin-top:0;margin-right:0;margin-bottom:0;margin-left:0;padding:0 0 0 0 ;text-align:center"><span style=";font-family:Calibri;color:rgb(51,51,51);font-size:13px"><span style="font-family:宋体">秦沈涛</span></span></p><p>
</p><p style="margin-top:0;margin-right:0;margin-bottom:0;margin-left:0;text-indent:30px;padding:0 0 0 0 ;text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph"><span style=";font-family:宋体;color:rgb(51,51,51);font-size:13px">据悉，本次浙江生物奥赛省队选拔共选出省一队</span><span style=";font-family:Calibri;color:rgb(51,51,51);font-size:13px">17</span><span style=";font-family:宋体;color:rgb(51,51,51);font-size:13px"><span style="font-family:宋体">人，来自全省各地市学校的尖子生竞争异常激烈，入选分数的差距也在毫厘之间。绍兴一中生物竞赛教练、秦沈涛的指导老师俞宝根介绍说：</span>“秦同学在生物学习上比较有钻研精神，高一时就已经拿到了全国联赛（浙江赛区）一等奖，高二经过不断训练表现得更为成熟，能够入选省队，是对他学习的进一步鼓励，希望他在全国决赛上取得更大成绩。当然，能取得好成绩，还要感谢他的班主任黄伟中老师，没有班主任和各位任课老师的支持，竞赛也难以行稳致远！”</span></p><p style="margin-top:0;margin-right:0;margin-bottom:0;margin-left:0;text-indent:30px;padding:0 0 0 0 ;text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph"><span style=";font-family:宋体;color:rgb(51,51,51);font-size:13px">作为金牌指导教练，俞宝根老师曾获全国优质课一等奖，已经先后输送了多名省队苗子：</span><span style=";font-family:Calibri;color:rgb(51,51,51);font-size:13px">2016</span><span style=";font-family:宋体;color:rgb(51,51,51);font-size:13px">年指导学生张悠然高一进入省队，后获得全国金牌并获一本线降分录取进入清华；</span><span style=";font-family:Calibri;color:rgb(51,51,51);font-size:13px">2019</span><span style=";font-family:宋体;color:rgb(51,51,51);font-size:13px"><span style="font-family:宋体">年指导学生易澍渲进入省队，后获得全国银牌并通过</span>“强基计划”进入清华。</span></p><p style="margin-top:0;margin-right:0;margin-bottom:0;margin-left:0;text-indent:30px;padding:0 0 0 0 ;text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph"><span style=";font-family:宋体;color:rgb(51,51,51);font-size:13px">在此，对取得优异成绩的学生、教练辅导团队表示祝贺，对付出辛勤工作的教练团队、班主任、任课老师及学生家长等表示衷心感谢！</span></p><p style="margin-top:0;margin-right:0;margin-bottom:0;margin-left:0;text-indent:30px;padding:0 0 0 0 ;text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph"><span style=";font-family:Calibri;font-size:16px"> </span></p><p><span style=";font-family:Calibri;font-size:14px"> </span></p><p style="margin-top:0;margin-right:0;margin-bottom:0;margin-left:0;padding:0 0 0 0 ;text-align:center"><strong><span style="font-family: Calibri;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);font-size: 13px"><span style="font-family:宋体">绍兴一中获奖名单</span></span></strong></p><p style="margin-top:0;margin-right:0;margin-bottom:0;margin-left:0;padding:0 0 0 0 ;text-align:center"><strong><span style="font-family: Calibri;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);font-size: 13px"> </span></strong></p><p style="margin-top:0;margin-right:0;margin-bottom:0;margin-left:0;text-align:center"><strong><span style=";font-family:华文楷体;color:rgb(192,0,0);font-size:13px">联赛一等奖</span></strong></p><p style="margin-top:0;margin-right:0;margin-bottom:0;margin-left:0;text-align:center"><span style=";font-family:宋体;color:rgb(51,51,51);font-size:13px">秦沈涛（高二）</span></p><p style="margin-top:0;margin-right:0;margin-bottom:0;margin-left:0;text-align:center"><span style=";font-family:宋体;color:rgb(51,51,51);font-size:13px"><span style="font-family:宋体">吴</span> 越（高二）</span></p><p style="margin-top:0;margin-right:0;margin-bottom:0;margin-left:0;text-align:center"><span style=";font-family:宋体;color:rgb(51,51,51);font-size:13px">陈逸飞（高二）</span></p><p style="margin-top:0;margin-right:0;margin-bottom:0;margin-left:0;text-align:center"><span style=";font-family:宋体;color:rgb(51,51,51);font-size:13px"> </span></p><p style="margin-top:0;margin-right:0;margin-bottom:0;margin-left:0;text-align:center"><strong><span style=";font-family:华文楷体;color:rgb(192,0,0);font-size:13px">联赛二等奖</span></strong></p><p style="margin-top:0;margin-right:0;margin-bottom:0;margin-left:0;text-align:center"><span style=";font-family:宋体;color:rgb(51,51,51);font-size:13px">徐鲲鹏（高二）</span></p><p style="margin-top:0;margin-right:0;margin-bottom:0;margin-left:0;text-align:center"><span style=";font-family:宋体;color:rgb(51,51,51);font-size:13px">陈立言（高二）</span></p><p style="margin-top:0;margin-right:0;margin-bottom:0;margin-left:0;text-align:center"><span style=";font-family:宋体;color:rgb(51,51,51);font-size:13px"><span style="font-family:宋体">徐</span> 蓁（高二）</span></p><p style="margin-top:0;margin-right:0;margin-bottom:0;margin-left:0;text-align:center"><span style=";font-family:宋体;color:rgb(51,51,51);font-size:13px">陈音曼（高一）</span></p><p style="margin-top:0;margin-right:0;margin-bottom:0;margin-left:0;text-align:center"><span style=";font-family:宋体;color:rgb(51,51,51);font-size:13px">钟佳怡（高二）</span></p><p style="margin-top:0;margin-right:0;margin-bottom:0;margin-left:0;text-align:center"><span style=";font-family:宋体;color:rgb(51,51,51);font-size:13px"> </span></p><p style="margin-top:0;margin-right:0;margin-bottom:0;margin-left:0;text-align:center"><strong><span style=";font-family:华文楷体;color:rgb(192,0,0);font-size:13px">联赛三等奖</span></strong></p><p style="margin-top:0;margin-right:0;margin-bottom:0;margin-left:0;text-align:center"><span style=";font-family:宋体;color:rgb(51,51,51);font-size:13px">俞可炀（高一）</span></p><p style="margin-top:0;margin-right:0;margin-bottom:0;margin-left:0;text-align:center"><span style=";font-family:宋体;color:rgb(51,51,51);font-size:13px">杨陈韬（高二）</span></p><p style="margin-top:0;margin-right:0;margin-bottom:0;margin-left:0;text-align:center"><span style=";font-family:宋体;color:rgb(51,51,51);font-size:13px">范泽祺（高一）</span></p><p style="margin-top:0;margin-right:0;margin-bottom:0;margin-left:0;text-align:center"><span style=";font-family:宋体;color:rgb(51,51,51);font-size:13px">刘语桐（高一）</span></p><p style="margin-top:0;margin-right:0;margin-bottom:0;margin-left:0;text-align:center"><span style=";font-family:宋体;color:rgb(51,51,51);font-size:13px">胡淑闲（高二）</span></p><p style="margin-top:0;margin-right:0;margin-bottom:0;margin-left:0;text-align:center"><span style=";font-family:宋体;color:rgb(51,51,51);font-size:13px">张吴健（高一）</span></p><p style="margin-top:0;margin-right:0;margin-bottom:0;margin-left:0;text-align:center"><span style=";font-family:宋体;color:rgb(51,51,51);font-size:13px">王哲煜（高一）</span></p><p>
</p>
    
